<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ampolex convertible notes suspended.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ampolex convertible notes suspended.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampolex Ltd convertible notes will be suspended from the start of Tuesday trade at the request of the company, the Australian Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Ampolex, a unit of Mobil Corp, said in a letter to the stock exchange that it expected an announcement would made before the start of trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
